/**
 * The MAGENTA lockup, inlined.
 *
 * Taken from "Magenta WHITE logo SVG.svg" in the brand kit - the official
 * artwork, not a trace of it. Inlined rather than served as <img> so it
 * inherits currentColor: the same file sits white on the magenta header and
 * white on the dark footer, and a baked-in fill would go invisible the moment
 * either ground changed. The magenta-on-light version of the lockup lives at
 * assets/img/brand/logo.svg for anywhere that needs it as a file.
 *
 * The viewBox is cropped to the ink. The supplied file is 936x360 with the
 * lockup floating inside it, and that padding would otherwise have to be
 * guessed at by every rule that sizes the logo. Cropped, the box is the
 * artwork: set a height and the width follows at 3.09:1.
 *
 * The link that wraps this carries the accessible name, so the drawing itself
 * is hidden from assistive technology.
 *
 * Args (via get_template_part $args):
 *   tagline (bool) - include the CREATIVE STUDIO line. Default true.
 *
 * @package Magenta
 */

if ( ! defined( 'ABSPATH' ) ) {
	exit;
}

